UPDATE case_studies SET summary = '<p>AI Appliance Repairs is an appliance repair business that came to us with a very small online footprint. When the project began, the website was receiving only a handful of organic visits, and the business had little visibility when customers searched for repair services. The objective of this project was to change that by building a strong local SEO foundation and a well-managed Google Business Profile, so that people with a broken appliance could find the business quickly and contact it easily.</p>
<p>The results over the six-month comparison period were significant. Organic clicks grew from 40 to 524, a 13x increase. Search impressions rose from 614 to 22,400, meaning the business now appears in front of far more people who are actively searching for appliance repairs. The Google Business Profile also recorded 425 interactions, including 79 phone calls, 283 website clicks and 56 direction requests, giving AI Appliance Repairs a strong base of local demand from the very start.</p>

<h3>How We Work</h3>
<p>Our team began by understanding how AI Appliance Repairs operates: the appliances it repairs, the customers it wants to attract and the way people search when something stops working. Appliance repair is an urgent, high-intent service. Customers usually search on their phone, compare a few options and contact the first business that looks trustworthy and available. Our strategy was built around that behaviour.</p>
<p><strong>Local SEO and keyword optimisation.</strong> We researched the search terms customers use when they need a repair and mapped them to the right pages on the website. Page titles, headings, descriptions and content were optimised so search engines could clearly understand what the business offers and who it serves, while the copy stayed simple and useful for real customers.</p>
<p><strong>Google Business Profile setup and management.</strong> For a local repair business, the Google Business Profile is often the first thing a customer sees. We set up and optimised the profile so that the business information, services and contact details were complete and consistent. We then managed it on an ongoing basis to strengthen the business''s visibility in local search results and on Google Maps.</p>
<p><strong>Website click and call tracking.</strong> Visibility only matters if it turns into enquiries. We set up click and call tracking so that we could see how customers were reaching the business, whether by calling directly, clicking through to the website or requesting directions. This showed which parts of the strategy were working and where to focus next.</p>
<p><strong>Ongoing performance reporting.</strong> Every month we reviewed the data from Google Search Console and the Google Business Profile and used it to refine the strategy. This kept the campaign focused on measurable results rather than guesswork.</p>

<h3>Results &amp; Outcomes</h3>
<p>The campaign delivered a fast and measurable improvement in AI Appliance Repairs'' online visibility. Organic clicks increased 13x, from 40 to 524, while search impressions grew from 614 to 22,400. This growth shows that the website is now appearing for many more relevant searches, and that customers are clicking through to it.</p>
<p>The Google Search Console data also points to a strong ranking position. An average position of 11.8 means the website is appearing around the top of the first page and the start of the second page for its target searches, and a 2.3% average click-through rate shows that searchers are choosing the listing when they see it.</p>
<p>The Google Business Profile has become a direct source of customer enquiries. Across the period, it recorded 425 total interactions:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>79 phone calls</strong> from customers ready to book a repair</li>
<li><strong>283 website clicks</strong> from customers wanting to learn more about the service</li>
<li><strong>56 direction requests</strong> from customers looking to locate the business</li>
</ul>
<p>These actions matter because they come from people who are actively searching for an appliance repair service, not from casual browsing. With the base now established, AI Appliance Repairs is well placed to keep improving its rankings, expand into more search terms and convert more of that visibility into booked repairs through continued optimisation.</p>

<h3>Project Highlights</h3>
<p>Our objective was to build a strong local search presence from the ground up and turn online visibility into measurable calls, clicks and enquiries.</p>
<ul>
<li>Local SEO and keyword optimisation</li>
<li>Google Business Profile setup and management</li>
<li>Website click and call tracking</li>
<li>Ongoing performance reporting</li>
<li>Organic clicks up 13x, from 40 to 524</li>
<li>Search impressions up from 614 to 22,400</li>
<li>Average position of 11.8 in Google search</li>
<li>425 Google Business Profile interactions, including 79 calls</li>
</ul>' WHERE slug = 'ai-appliance-repairs';

UPDATE case_studies SET summary = '<p>Fridge Repair Experts is a specialist fridge repair business. It entered this period building its organic search and Google Business Profile presence from the ground up. A broken fridge is one of the most urgent household problems, because food spoils quickly and customers want a fast, reliable repairer. The objective of this project was to make sure that when people search for fridge repairs, Fridge Repair Experts appears in front of them, looks trustworthy and is easy to contact.</p>
<p>Over six months, the website generated 971 organic clicks from 162K search impressions. The Google Business Profile drove 334 direct interactions, including 37 phone calls, 223 direction requests and 74 website clicks. Together, these results give the business a steady, measurable flow of local enquiries and a strong platform for further growth.</p>

<h3>How We Work</h3>
<p>Our approach was built around local search, because fridge repair customers almost always look for a business in their own area. They want someone nearby who can attend quickly.</p>
<p><strong>Local SEO and Google Business Profile management.</strong> We optimised the Google Business Profile so that the business could appear in local search results and on Google Maps for fridge repair searches. Keeping the profile accurate, complete and actively managed helps customers trust the business and take action, whether that means calling, visiting the website or getting directions.</p>
<p><strong>Service area content.</strong> Customers search for fridge repairs by location, so we developed service area content that helps the website appear for searches across the areas the business serves. Each page was written to give real, useful information, including the services offered and how to get in touch, rather than repeating generic text.</p>
<p><strong>Call and enquiry tracking.</strong> We set up tracking to measure how customers were contacting the business. This gave a clear picture of which actions were driving enquiries and made it possible to judge the campaign by real customer activity, not just rankings.</p>
<p><strong>Ongoing performance reporting.</strong> Each month we reviewed Google Search Console and Google Business Profile data, identified what was working and adjusted the strategy. This kept the campaign focused on steady, measurable improvement.</p>

<h3>Results &amp; Outcomes</h3>
<p>Fridge Repair Experts now has a visible and growing presence in local search. The website recorded 162K search impressions over six months, which shows that the business is appearing in front of a very large number of people looking for fridge repair services. Those impressions turned into 971 organic clicks to the website.</p>
<p>The Google Business Profile has become a strong source of local enquiries, with 334 total interactions:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>223 direction requests</strong>, showing that a large number of customers actively looked for the business''s location</li>
<li><strong>74 website clicks</strong> from customers wanting to know more about the service</li>
<li><strong>37 phone calls</strong> from customers ready to book a repair</li>
</ul>
<p>The Search Console data also shows where the next stage of growth lies. With an average position of 26 and a 0.6% average click-through rate, the website is being seen very widely, and there is strong room to improve rankings and turn more of those impressions into clicks. Moving the main pages higher in search results is the natural next step, and it is exactly what continued optimisation is designed to achieve.</p>
<p>Because the business started this period with almost no established presence, these numbers represent a solid foundation. Fridge Repair Experts now has the visibility, the tracking and the local profile in place to keep building enquiries month after month.</p>

<h3>Project Highlights</h3>
<p>Our objective was to build a strong local search presence from the ground up and create a steady, measurable flow of fridge repair enquiries.</p>
<ul>
<li>Local SEO and Google Business Profile management</li>
<li>Call and enquiry tracking</li>
<li>Service area content</li>
<li>Ongoing performance reporting</li>
<li>971 organic clicks from 162K search impressions</li>
<li>334 Google Business Profile interactions</li>
<li>223 direction requests from local customers</li>
</ul>' WHERE slug = 'fridge-repair-experts';
